            source(2, "r2", "PATTERN", second.toString())));
    String summary = facts.facts().get(0).text();
    assertTrue(summary.contains("123456789012aaaaaaaa：S1"), summary);
    assertTrue(summary.contains("123456789012bbbbbbbb：S2"), summary);
